// The proofs of the RPC bindings: gRPC, Connect, JSON-RPC and Sparrow,
// their generators and their docs, across the spec's areas.
rpc_bindings: section {
  | The tests that prove the requirements of the spec's RPC bindings: [gRPC and Connect](#heron.language.apis.grpc),
  | [JSON-RPC](#heron.language.apis.jsonrpc), [Sparrow](#heron.language.apis.sparrow), the [proto](#heron.tools.proto),
  | [OpenRPC](#heron.tools.openrpc) and [Sparrow](#heron.tools.sparrow) generators and the docs' views of services and methods.

  proves(heron.language.core_format.nodes.annotations.ambiguous_annotations) {
